.TH "ANX" "1" "Oct 2026" "anx 1.0.0" "Anx User Manual"

.SH NAME
anx-upgrade - Upgrade environment: pull repo, update tools, apply package plans, and sync dotfiles


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBanx upgrade [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Perform an end-to-end upgrade of the workstation environment:
.IP "  1." 5
Fast-forward pull latest repository changes (if working tree is clean).
.IP "  2." 5
Upgrade personal decoupled tools in ~/.local/share/anx/bin.
.IP "  3." 5
Compute and apply package installation plan for the active profile.
.IP "  4." 5
Reconcile and synchronize dotfiles using 3-way merge.
.IP "  5." 5
(Optional) Apply matched workstation hardware hacks if --include-hacks is provided.


